WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.891
Traditional models had features. Income, utilization, months on book. Each one had a distribution you could monitor.

2
00:00:07.900 --> 00:00:16.271
A I agents do not. The system prompt is a feature. The user input is a feature. Both are paragraphs of text.

3
00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:19.031
Feature-importance analysis breaks.

4
00:00:19.033 --> 00:00:22.764
The fix is to treat the prompt as a versioned component,

5
00:00:22.767 --> 00:00:26.698
and track outputs against demographics at the population level.
